ts?category=water",{"_108":113,"_110":114},"工业测量","/zh-CN/products?category=industrial",{"_108":116,"_110":117},"气体检测","/zh-CN/products?category=gas",{"_103":119,"_105":120},"了解更多",[121,124,127,130,133],{"_108":122,"_110":123},"关于我们","/zh-CN/about",{"_108":125,"_110":126},"客户案例","/zh-CN/cases",{"_108":128,"_110":129},"新闻中心","/zh-CN/news",{"_108":131,"_110":132},"售后服务","/zh-CN/service",{"_108":134,"_110":135},"下载中心","/zh-CN/downloads","cooperationTitle","cooperationBody","footerQrCodes",[],"kind","quality",[],[],"seo",{"_103":146,"_147":91,"_148":-5,"_149":150},"质量体系 | IGENU SCIENCE","description","imageUrl","index",true,"canonical","https://eicloc.github.io/igenu-preview/zh-CN/quality","query",{},"selected",[],"page",{"_57":141,"_103":159,"_160":161,"_229":230,"_144":145},"质量体系","sections",[162],{"_163":164,"_165":166,"_7":167,"_184":185,"_221":222},"id","c8478894-2fa2-4e49-8494-0ee8361a6ede","type","TEXT_IMAGE",{"_168":38,"_169":170,"_171":172,"_173":174,"_182":183},"body","heading","测量服务的质量","bodyHtml","<p>自成立以来，IGENU 一直在不断改进和发展其服务质量，目标非常明确：</p><p>消费者满意度</p><p>研究并提出完美适应不断变化的客户需求的解决方案</p><p>对于环境分析专家 IGENU 而言，质量是其座右铭。 从设计阶段到生产、销售和最后的售后服务，各级都制定了规则和程序。</p><p>除了这个质量体系之外，其高科技监控领域不仅需要对其员工的技能和资格给予最大的关注，而且还需要对其安全给予最大的关注。</p>","sourceNotes",[175],{"_103":159,"_176":150,"_171":177,"_178":179,"_180":181},"pending","<p>重视安全管理，IGENU正在取得“Mase”认证（Safety Improvement Company Manual）</p>","sourceUrl","http://www.igenu.com/cn/QUALITY.html","capturedAt","2026-10-21T04:13:22.254Z","imagePosition","right","media",{"_163":186,"_140":187,"_188":189,"_190":191,"_192":193,"_194":195,"_196":197,"_198":199,"_200":201,"_202":203,"_204":205},"344c8a4b-2071-4a60-b39f-ad6293a62421","IMAGE","originalName","banner3.jpg","mimeType","image/jpeg","size",285196,"sha256","3307a46109e89d7eaed9506ca1f29c7b8aba7a378fbc209a464058e044b3367c","width",1200,"height",334,"url","/igenu-preview/media/3307a46109e89d7eaed9506c.jpg","createdAt","2026-10-20T17:32:39.545Z","variants",[206,211,215,219],{"_196":207,"_198